-- We do NOT insert any rows in t4, t5 or t6 for bar 'B1'.
-- As a result, Q1 will return 'B1' (since the inner NOT EXISTS condition is vacuously true),
-- but Q2 will produce no result because it aggregates over t4 and 'B1' never appears there.

